Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:10.03,Default JP,,0,0,0,,時間は 止められない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:10.03,Default CN,,0,0,0,,时间不会停止
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:12.00,Default JP,,0,0,0,,戻せない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:12.00,Default CN,,0,0,0,,不会倒流
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:14.57,Default JP,,0,0,0,,でも...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:14.57,Default CN,,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:19.54,Default JP,,0,0,0,,変えてみせる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:19.54,Default CN,,0,0,0,,可以改变
Comment: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:15.49,Default JP,,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:28.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}世界は いま きらめくよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:28.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}现在 世界如此璀璨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:31.97,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}わたしが そう 決めたから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:31.97,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}所以我下定决心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:38.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}笑顔にひかりを もう一度 うららかに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:38.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}让自己再次绽放笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:41.31,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}誰かの いのちじゃなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:41.31,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}看吧 我就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:47.44,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}わたしを踊りつづける ほらね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:47.44,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}活出我自己的精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:51.32,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}ときめきの日々は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:51.32,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}我追梦的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:56.20,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}ずっと終わらない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:56.20,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}永远不会结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:58.70,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1\c&H7E20BB&}希望之力 {\c&HBAB325&}大人Precure' 23
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.04,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}世界を 愛せなくても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.04,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}世界以痛吻我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:13.20,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}こころが 悪いんじゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:13.20,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}心仍报之以歌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:19.65,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}涙は かならず あたらしい夢になる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:19.65,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}眼泪一定会聚成另一个梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:22.68,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}誰かのいのちじゃなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:22.68,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}我就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:26.64,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}わたしを踊りつづける
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:26.64,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}活出我自己的精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.94,0:01:28.81,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}ほらね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.94,0:01:28.81,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.72,0:01:32.45,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}ときめきの日々は
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.72,0:01:32.45,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}我追梦的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.89,0:01:38.88,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur4\fad(200,200)}ずっと終わらない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.89,0:01:38.88,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}永远不会结束
